B.dcy=new A.T("Recebes \u20ac{0} desta entrega. A volta j\xe1 est\xe1 paga \u2014 n\xe3o cobres nada ao cliente.","You get \u20ac{0} for this delivery. The return leg is already paid \u2014 do not charge the customer anything.")
B.deo=new A.T("Recebes \u20ac{0} desta entrega. O cliente j\xe1 pagou os \u20ac{1} online \u2014 n\xe3o cobres nada ao cliente.","You get \u20ac{0} for this delivery. The customer already paid the \u20ac{1} online \u2014 do not charge them anything.")
B.df4=new A.T("Recebes \u20ac{0} desta entrega. Os \u20ac{1} que o cliente paga N\xc3O s\xe3o teus \u2014 recolhes em m\xe3o por conta da Bora, que acerta contigo no fim da semana.","You get \u20ac{0} for this delivery. The \u20ac{1} the customer pays are NOT yours \u2014 you collect them for Bora, which settles with you at the end of the week.")
